WEBVTT

NOTE
Sorceress Edea presented at the parade gate.
Duration: approximately 9 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
A heavy metal gate drops in front of the throne, blocking Edea’s path.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Edea stands, her face clouded with unease.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The rear metal gate crashes down, sealing her within the triumphal gate.